{"id":4898,"mal_id":4898,"title":"Kuroshitsuji","englishTitle":"Black Butler","title_english":"Black Butler","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Kuro Shitsuji","Kuroshitsuzi"],"en":"Black Butler","ja":"黒執事"},"synopsis":"Young Ciel Phantomhive is known as \"the Queen's Guard Dog,\" taking care of the many unsettling events that occur in Victorian England for Her Majesty. Aided by Sebastian Michaelis, his loyal butler with seemingly inhuman abilities, Ciel uses whatever means necessary to get the job done. But is there more to this black-clad butler than meets the eye?\n\nIn Ciel's past lies a secret tragedy that enveloped him in perennial darkness—during one of his bleakest moments, he formed a contract with Sebastian, a demon, bargaining his soul in exchange for vengeance upon those who wronged him. Today, not only is Sebastian one hell of a butler, but he is also the perfect servant to carry out his master's orders—all the while anticipating the delicious meal he will eventually make of Ciel's soul. As the two work to unravel the mystery behind Ciel's chain of misfortunes, a bond forms between them that neither heaven nor hell can tear apart.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"El joven Ciel Phantomhive es conocido como \"el perro guardián de la reina\", y se ocupa de los muchos acontecimientos inquietantes que ocurren en la Inglaterra victoriana para Su Majestad. Con la ayuda de Sebastian Michaelis, su leal mayordomo con habilidades aparentemente inhumanas, Ciel utiliza todos los medios necesarios para realizar el trabajo. ¿Pero hay más en este mayordomo vestido de negro de lo que parece?\n\nEn el pasado de Ciel se esconde una tragedia secreta que lo envolvió en una oscuridad perenne: durante uno de sus momentos más sombríos, formó un contrato con Sebastian, un demonio, negociando su alma a cambio de venganza contra aquellos que le hicieron daño. Hoy en día, Sebastian no solo es un gran mayordomo, sino que también es el sirviente perfecto para cumplir las órdenes de su amo, mientras anticipa la deliciosa comida que eventualmente preparará con el alma de Ciel. Mientras los dos trabajan para desentrañar el misterio detrás de la cadena de desgracias de Ciel, se forma un vínculo entre ellos que ni el cielo ni el infierno pueden romper.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1469,"average_episode_duration":1469,"startDate":"2008-10-03","start_date":"2008-10-03","endDate":"2009-03-27","end_date":"2009-03-27","season":"fall","year":2008,"start_season":{"year":2008,"season":"fall"},"episodes":24,"num_episodes":24,"score":7.65,"mean":7.65,"numListUsers":1291359,"num_list_users":1291359,"genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action"},{"id":13,"name":"Historical"},{"id":7,"name":"Mystery"},{"id":6,"name":"Mythology"},{"id":27,"name":"Shounen"},{"id":37,"name":"Supernatural"}],"studios":[{"id":56,"name":"A-1 Pictures"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1467/137783.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1467/137783l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1467/137783.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1467/137783l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1467/137783l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"friday","time":"01:25","day_of_the_week":"friday","start_time":"01:25","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"friday 01:25"},"rank":1633,"popularity":130,"rating":"r","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":653789,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2008-07-12T23:12:30+00:00","updated_at":"2025-03-11T05:53:31+00:00","source":"manga","background":null,"related_anime":[{"node":{"id":6163,"title":"Kuroshitsuji Recap","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1056